---
import BookLayout from "../layouts/BookLayout.astro";

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, "");
---

<BookLayout
	title="A note — Book Reviews by Arjun"
	description="Why these book reviews by Arjun are collected here, and shared."
>
	<main class="note-page">
		<div class="wrap">
			<a class="back" href={`${base}/`}>&larr; Home</a>

			<h1>A note</h1>


			<div class="prose">
				<p>
					After Arjun passed, I stumbled upon these book reviews
					again and found them comforting. They capture who he was so well:
					thoughtful, silly, and profound. Many of his family and
					friends remember him for his intellectual curiosity, and
					these reviews let me hear his voice again. I hope reading
					them, and perhaps picking up some of these books, helps
					you feel connected to him too. His
					thoughts are still here, and there is still so much more
					we can learn from him.
				</p>

				<p class="signature">&mdash; Ryan Lee</p>

				<p class="source">
					All the reviews come from his <a
						href="https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/154312131-arjun-v"
						target="_blank"
						rel="noopener noreferrer">Goodreads account</a>. The ratings
					and writing are preserved exactly as he left them&mdash;emojis,
					typos, line breaks, and all.
				</p>
			</div>

			<a class="btn" href={`${base}/#reviews`}>Reviews</a>
		</div>
	</main>
</BookLayout>

<style>
	.note-page {
		/* The note is meant to be read in one sitting: hold it to a single
		   screen so nothing scrolls out of view. */
		min-height: 100svh;
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		padding: clamp(2rem, 6vh, 4rem) 0;
		overflow: hidden;
	}

	.back {
		display: inline-block;
		margin-bottom: clamp(1.25rem, 4vh, 2.25rem);
		font-family: var(--sans);
		font-size: 0.78rem;
		letter-spacing: 0.1em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		color: var(--ink-soft);
		text-decoration: none;
		transition: color 0.2s ease;
	}

	.back:hover {
		color: var(--ink);
	}

	h1 {
		margin: 0 0 clamp(1rem, 3vh, 1.75rem);
		font-family: var(--serif);
		font-weight: 500;
		font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.6rem);
		letter-spacing: 0.01em;
	}

	.prose {
		/* Left-aligned at a reading measure: centering tires the eye once
		   the text runs past a few lines. */
		max-width: 62ch;
	}

	.prose p {
		margin: 0 0 1.1em;
		font-family: var(--serif);
		font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 2.2vw, 1.3rem);
		line-height: 1.6;
		text-wrap: pretty;
	}

	/* A quieter aside: it explains where the reviews came from rather
	   than continuing the thought above it. */
	.source {
		margin-top: clamp(1rem, 3vh, 1.75rem);
		font-size: clamp(0.95rem, 1.9vw, 1.1rem) !important;
		color: var(--ink-soft);
	}

	/* Signing the note rather than labelling the page: it names the
	   voice without turning the page into a credit. */
	.signature {
		/* Full paragraph color and size: the signature belongs to the note
		   above it, not to the quieter aside below. */
		margin: 0 0 clamp(1rem, 3vh, 1.75rem) !important;
		color: var(--ink);
	}

	.source a {
		color: inherit;
		text-decoration: underline;
		text-decoration-thickness: 1px;
		text-underline-offset: 0.18em;
		transition: color 0.2s ease;
	}

	.source a:hover {
		color: var(--ink);
	}

	.prose p:last-child {
		margin-bottom: clamp(1.5rem, 4vh, 2.5rem);
	}
</style>
